% layout 'auth';
% title 'Check your email';
<h2>Check your email</h2>
<div class="ok-banner">If an account with that login exists and has a recovery email on file, we've sent a password-reset link to it.</div>
<p>The link expires in 1 hour and can be used once. If nothing arrives, check the address is right and that a recovery email was set on the account.</p>
